  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>A large dry world with a thin atmosphere, three suns of very unequal brightness and a rotation of just under forty-one hours. Its plains are sorted regolith over a bedrock that carries sound extremely well, which is the single most consequential fact about the place. There are salt pans in the western basins, an endolithic biota through most of the crust, and no standing water anywhere. Survey protocol forbids ground vehicles within thirty kilometres of an occupied floor.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    },
    { "value": "<p>Suh svet s tremi sonci, kjer skala odlično prevaja zvok.</p>", "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "sl-SI"] }] }
  ],
